{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"blank_book_discovery","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":3,"title":"Weight of Pages","title_ko":"페이지의 무게"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"In the corner sat an Authority canvas satchel. Its dust was only a few weeks old.","text_ko":"구석에는 관리국 규격의 캔버스 가방이 놓여 있었다. 쌓인 먼지는 길어야 몇 주 된 것이었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Inside were rancid provisions, bandages, three Grain spheres, and a small leather-bound book with no title, seal, or registration stamp.","text_ko":"안에는 상한 식량과 붕대, 세 개의 그레인 구체, 그리고 제목도 봉인도 등록 도장도 없는 작은 가죽 책이 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch3_blank_book_warmth.png","portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Blank. Every page.","text_ko":"비어 있어. 모든 페이지가."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"No. Not blank. Unwritten.","text_ko":"아니. 빈 게 아니야. 쓰이지 않은 거야."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Elia took the book. Her breath shortened, and her fingers tightened around its spine.","text_ko":"엘리아가 책을 받아 들었다. 숨이 짧아졌고, 책등을 쥔 손가락에 힘이 들어갔다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"There's residue under the surface. A whole life's weight. This is record-tree fiber, a Blank Book.","text_ko":"표면 아래에 잔존이 있어. 한 생애 전체의 무게야. 기록목 섬유로 만든 백서야."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"I can't read it, but I can feel the pattern. The Authority burned every one they could find.","text_ko":"읽을 수는 없지만 패턴이 느껴져. 관리국은 찾는 족족 전부 태웠어."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Useful?","text_ko":"쓸모는 있고?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/8","jump":null,"original_index":8,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":8,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":8,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"I don't know yet. Let me carry it.","text_ko":"아직은 몰라. 내가 들게 해 줘."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/blank_book_discovery/9","jump":null,"original_index":9,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":1,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":9,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"[Obtained: Blank Book]","text_ko":"[획득: 백서]"}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"40a043cddaf4238e535c09d18bd172e0750b60337107c5720a0ca5eb75f7a222","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
